<!--
  "Required Skills" text field on Chatbot_Instruction__c (2026-10-28, Tim): Required_Skill_Names__c lists the names
  on the Required Skills related list, kept current by Apex (a formula can't read child rows).
    1. validate this manifest, RunSpecifiedTests with every ChatbotInstruction* test class, then quick-deploy
       (re-diff the Layout against live first: a Layout deploy replaces the whole live layout)
    2. python3 scripts/grant_required_skills_fls.py [-apply]  (Read like Reasoning_Effort__c, Edit for nobody)
    3. backfill: anonymous Apex
         ChatbotInstructionRequiredSkills.refresh(new Map<Id, Chatbot_Instruction__c>([SELECT Id FROM Chatbot_Instruction__c]).keySet());
  Also in this package: help text on the retired Instruction_Dependency__c and the Required_Skill__c object
  description (the last 2 legacy links were cleared the same day; both files are the live versions + that edit).
  The proxy never selects Required_Skill_Names__c, so no proxy change and no proxy-read check.
-->
<Package xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
